<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" class="sf">
<b> Posted by: [<a href="/forums/member.php?s=57c44f0561f7cdea788b1e4b09e90b8e&action=mailform&userid=96">Zaphod</a>] on 10-10-2003 @ 12:51 AM</b>
